{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is definitely a tough game. You can't do without patience and nerves of steel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is it about?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main character, the &quot;King of Slimes&quot;, is beige and a big fan of mango. For the sake of this delicacy, you will have to overcome difficult obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump over spikes and chasms, dodge cannonballs, avoid hostile slimes, but REACH THE END!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How about controls?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In words, it's simple. One eye on the slime, the other on the Power Scale. Stop the slider at the right place on the Power Scale with the &quot;Space&quot; key and make a jump. It will determine the strength of EVERY jump.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What else?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A unique character control system using the power scale;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A story mode of 4 acts. Will introduce you to the fate of the future &quot;King of Slimes&quot;;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Various obstacles with their own characteristics;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Level assessment on a three-star system depending on your progress;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 10 bright levels;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Beautiful and charming graphics.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Mango!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3827110/ccb1e72dcd23677a2d122614a87963439a1d6402.jpg"},{"name":"Coronation!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3827110/9155c06023c0f13128e11bfcc00739e00562b3cd.jpg"},{"name":"Start","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3827110/fd85a35f36733e927147e2fc8f06deb6cb410f22.jpg"},{"name":"Halfway","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3827110/c63a8a3194bc1d05e0c1dc6270b478d338763cff.jpg"},{"name":"Persistent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3827110/aeb359c9989bac0db0daebe88fe7932fd7c28343.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3827110?t=1758977506","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827110/8f37d62fe169273f9a8a36294229bdec51d7c93c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758977506","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827110/1d1845d95a315c8a57a771658990d1710180b754/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758977506","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827110/1d1845d95a315c8a57a771658990d1710180b754/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758977506","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is definitely a tough game. You can't do without patience and nerves of steel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is it about?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main character, the &quot;King of Slimes&quot;, is beige and a big fan of mango. For the sake of this delicacy, you will have to overcome difficult obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump over spikes and chasms, dodge cannonballs, avoid hostile slimes, but REACH THE END!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How about controls?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In words, it's simple. One eye on the slime, the other on the Power Scale. Stop the slider at the right place on the Power Scale with the &quot;Space&quot; key and make a jump. It will determine the strength of EVERY jump.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What else?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A unique character control system using the power scale;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A story mode of 4 acts. Will introduce you to the fate of the future &quot;King of Slimes&quot;;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Various obstacles with their own characteristics;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Level assessment on a three-star system depending on your progress;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 10 bright levels;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Beautiful and charming graphics.</p>","developers":["Phoenix World"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827110/11b7bacaa0a170c079cfc65758a5e15b648aaa3f/header.jpg?t=1758977506","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3827110/1402045476/033114ad18683a263bba506f101c50dee68d0e62/1751396585/dash_av1.mpd?t=1751398012","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3827110/1402045476/033114ad18683a263bba506f101c50dee68d0e62/1751396585/dash_h264.mpd?t=1751398012","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3827110/1402045476/033114ad18683a263bba506f101c50dee68d0e62/1751396585/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1751398012","id":257164023,"name":"Game Trailer Slime Way","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257164023/c1e6a045a449bdd61c47c27c214a46606c52effe/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1751398012"}],"name":"Slime Way","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option